(7548636, 1209203, 83313, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bothers me about this shot is the modern office building and cars in the background. Would have been difficult to get rid of them and stay within challenge rules, unless you are expert at cloning and willing to take some time with it. I might have selectively darkened those areas so that the viewer''s eye isn''t drawn to them quite as much. Otherwise, this is a fascinating shot. Sorry for what sounds like a lot of criticism, when it isn''t.</td>', 'The only thing that bothers me about this shot is the modern office building and cars in the background. Would have been difficult to get rid of them and stay within challenge rules, unless you are expert at cloning and willing to take some time with it. I might have selectively darkened those areas so that the viewer''s eye isn''t drawn to them quite as much. Otherwise, this is a fascinating shot. Sorry for what sounds like a lot of criticism, when it isn''t.', '2017-12-16 11:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
