(7549683, 1209262, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>Lovely landscape Jonathon. I love the diminutive figure of the surfer it gives a sense of scale to what one of your commenters describes as small waves but clearly his presence shows they are larger than is at first appreciated. I think perhaps you could have given it slightly less exposure to reduce the blow highlights, anyway, well done with your score and placing</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge well Lovely landscape Jonathon. I love the diminutive figure of the surfer it gives a sense of scale to what one of your commenters describes as small waves but clearly his presence shows they are larger than is at first appreciated. I think perhaps you could have given it slightly less exposure to reduce the blow highlights, anyway, well done with your score and placing', '2017-12-24 17:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
